      "side": 1,
      "message": "the below combined map is overhead\nEvery aggregation request allocates a new heap map, copies all entries then discards it. Since emSatelliteSources and aggregationSources are already in-memory and consistent, this copy is pure overhead.\nstatic void aggregateAndHandle(\n    AggregationType aggType,\n    const std::shared_ptr\u003ccrow::Request\u003e\u0026 sharedReq,\n    const std::shared_ptr\u003cbmcweb::AsyncResp\u003e\u0026 asyncResp,\n    const std::unordered_map\u003cstd::string, boost::urls::url\u003e\u0026 emSources,\n    const std::unordered_map\u003cstd::string, AggregationSource\u003e\u0026 restSources)\n\nfindSatellite already takes satelliteInfo as a parameter — it should not need to call getInstance() inside its body at all. Both maps can be passed by const-ref from startAggregation, eliminating the singleton re-entry and the heap allocation.",
      "parentUuid": "09d3a6ad_8c24ce42",
      "revId": "e373fc81af1ff11afd0dec2b89cf61c82a1a4021",
